T* (WHY WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT AND RAG LLM WORK VARY IN VALUE) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (This section is a deliberate reading gate. It explains why two lanes that look similar on a brochure - public website / page UI development, and RAG + LLM knowledge) Tj
T* (work - do not move in lockstep, do not age the same way, and do not deliver the same compounding return curve over the life of an enquiry funnel.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (1. TWO LANES, TWO CLOCKS) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
5.2 TL
T* (Website / page UI work is largely presentational and editorial: layout, content blocks, editor permissions, visual hierarchy, mobile behaviour, CTA placement, and the) Tj
T* (surfaces visitors see. Once shipped, much of that value is immediately visible. Visitors see more - clearer packages, clearer paths, clearer proof. That visibility is) Tj
T* (real and useful. It is also relatively static between redesigns. A page can look finished while the answering brain behind the chat remains shallow.) Tj
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (RAG + LLM work is infrastructural. It decides whether an enquiry is grounded, abstains correctly, routes to Book a chat, protects published guide figures, and keeps) Tj
T* (calling language inclusive. Visitors may not see embeddings, chunk boundaries, rerankers, or abstention rules. They experience the absence of nonsense. That is why RAG) Tj
T* (has a necessity character: without retrieval grounding, fluent answers drift; with grounding, enquiry quality compounds as the corpus is curated.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (2. ENQUIRY VALUE OVER TIME AS MODELS IMPROVE) Tj
/F5 5 Tf
5.6 TL
T* (Language models improve on a faster cadence than wedding-season website redesign cycles. As base models get better at following instructions, the marginal value of a) Tj
T* (clean RAG corpus, good chunking, and strict escalation rules rises - because better models amplify whatever you retrieve. If you retrieve accurate Schuggie materials,) Tj
T* (better models explain them more clearly. If you retrieve nothing useful, better models invent more confidently. That is the asymmetry.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (Therefore the enquire-value curve is not pay once for a pretty page and finished. It is keep the retrieval spine honest so future model upgrades increase conversion) Tj
T* (help instead of increasing hallucination risk. Hourly RAG attention - corpus hygiene, re-ingest after FAQ edits, figure-integrity tests, suggestion URL checks - is not) Tj
T* (optional theatre. It is the maintenance that lets enquiry value rise as LLMs improve.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (3. WHY THE WEBSITE CAN LOOK DONE WHILE RAG IS STILL THE BOTTLENECK) Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
T* (A polished page can increase trust quickly. Visitors see packages, toolkit, corporate paths, and CTAs. That is the see-more effect. But the chat is where uncertain) Tj
T* (couples ask the awkward questions: beginners, travel extras, sound limiters, first-dance anxiety, try-before-book, corporate fit. If RAG is thin, the pretty page still) Tj
T* (leaks enquiries into confusion or invented certainty. If RAG is strong, the page and the chat reinforce each other: the site shows; the bot grounds; Book a chat stays) Tj
T* (human.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (4. NECESSITY OF ONGOING RAG HOURS) Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (RAG hours cover ingestion discipline, evaluation rubrics, failure-mode testing, stateful consult behaviour at higher levels, and separation from page-editor lanes.) Tj
T* (These hours do not disappear after first launch. Models change. FAQs change. Package guide messaging changes. Toolkit links change. Each change is a chance to either) Tj
T* (compound enquiry value or inject drift. The necessity is continuous enough that delivery planning treats RAG as a living lane, not a one-afternoon toggle.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F1 5.2 Tf
5.8 TL
T* (5. WHY VALUES DIVERGE BETWEEN BUILDS) Tj
/F2 5 Tf
5.6 TL
T* (Two clients can pick similar page-editor levels and still need different RAG depth because their enquiry mix differs: more package questions, more corporate routing,) Tj
T* (more travel edge cases, more first-dance handholding. Complexity bands on the brochure are delivery signals for that mix. They are not a sticker on the page. Website) Tj
T* (lane effort can be front-loaded into visible UI. RAG lane effort is front-loaded into invisible correctness and then sustained as corpus truth.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (6. COMPOUNDING vs SNAPSHOT VALUE) Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
T* (Website snapshot value: visitors see an improved surface now. RAG compounding value: each grounded answer teaches the funnel what to ask next, what to escalate, and) Tj
T* (what to stop inventing. As LLMs improve, compounding accelerates only if retrieval stays strict. That is why this receipt spends unusual length on RAG operator detail) Tj
