T* (A1. WHAT RAG IS \(AGAIN, LONGER\)) Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (RAG means Retrieval-Augmented Generation. The system does not answer from model memory alone. It retrieves passages from an approved knowledge corpus, then asks a) Tj
T* (language model to draft an answer constrained to those passages. If retrieval confidence is low, the system abstains and routes to Book a chat. RAG is not fine-tuning.) Tj
T* (RAG is not "ChatGPT with a Scottish accent." RAG is not permission to invent package prices, travel fees, insurance limits, availability holds, or venue licensing) Tj
