T* (A3. CHUNKING POLICY \(DETAILED\)) Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
T* (Documents are split into overlapping chunks that respect headings and FAQ question boundaries. Target chunk size band: approximately 180-420 tokens depending on section) Tj
T* (density. Overlap band: approximately 40-80 tokens so multi-sentence price answers do not lose the figure. Do not merge unrelated FAQs into one chunk. Do not split) Tj
T* (mid-price figure. Preserve East Midlands / travel-extra caveats with the price chunk. Preserve "Book a chat is not a hard sell" language with first-dance and) Tj
