/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (Each chunk is embedded into a vector representation capturing semantic meaning, not only keywords. Index may be hybrid: dense vectors + sparse keyword / BM25 style) Tj
T* (signals for exact figures \(877, 1597, 4927, 0.55/mile, 20/hour\). Query rewriting may expand visitor slang \("how dear is the band"\) into retrieval-friendly forms without) Tj
T* (inventing new commercial terms. Reranking may reorder top-k chunks before generation. Top-k default band for production: 3-8 chunks depending on intelligence level) Tj
