T* (## What is it that you actually do?) Tj
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (Hosts and *calls* ceilidhs for weddings, birthdays, socials, fundraisers, and other parties so the client can relax. Authentic Scottish ceilidh \(Schuggie is from) Tj
T* (Inverness\) with a contemporary twist - fun, social, inclusive. Also MC's the evening flow: food timing with caterers, bouquet/sparklers/fireworks, Auld Lang Syne,) Tj
T* (stay-or-leave timing.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (## What does Calling mean?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F2 5 Tf
5.6 TL
T* (Calling = directing the dancing. Most guests have never been to a ceilidh; the Caller guides left/right/moves. Mistakes are encouraged. Inclusive entertainment.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (## Does that mean you teach the dances?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (Not formal teaching - ceilidh is not that technical. Open ceilidh evenings in the East Midlands \(Sep-late April\) via Nottingham Ceilidh Club; also fundraising /) Tj
T* (festival / Burns / St Patrick's / St Andrews events to try first.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (## Does that mean we can have a Ceilidh first dance?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (Yes - couple or all guests. Book a ceilidh chat to discuss \(not a hard sales call; ideally both partners available\).) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F2 5 Tf
5.6 TL
T* (## Is it suitable for beginners?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F4 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (Yes. Caller role exists for beginners; Ceilidh Ninjas still rely on the Caller. Simple dances, fun pace.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (## Can we try it out first?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (Yes - open ceilidh evenings; testimonials on Google My Business, Facebook, Pinterest. Book a chat for wedding or party planning.) Tj
