5.4 TL
T* (## What services do you offer?) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
T* (Core: hosting ceilidhs for parties \(weddings, birthdays, socials\). Works with bands and event pros for packages. **Fee is the same regardless of event type** \(no) Tj
T* (wedding markup\). Bespoke packages for wedding, corporate, workshops \(Diversity, Inclusion & Enrichment\).) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
