/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F3 4.8 Tf
5.4 TL
T* (Usually chat first \(fit check\). Can reserve date + deposit then chat. Then Booking Form + Terms & Conditions + invoice. Confirmed when form returned + deposit paid.) Tj
T* (Touchpoints during planning; balance usually **3 months before** the day.) Tj
/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F6 5.1 Tf
5.7 TL
