/F1 4.6 Tf
1.6 TL
T* () Tj
/F2 5 Tf
5.6 TL
T* (As soon as possible - even without date/venue. Prices currently fixed till 2028; availability checkable till 2028. Wedding chat ~20 minutes; both partners ideally) Tj
